<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  1.27 % (Discount)	C/S =  Par</p>
<p>	    O/N =  1.27 % (Discount)	O/N =  Par</p>
<p>	    T/N =  1.27 % (Discount)	T/N =  Par</p>
<p>		   April 9, 1997		    April 7, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  2.72 %     1 month forward =  3.73 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  4.07 %     2 month forward =  4.92 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  5.09 %     3 month forward =  5.65 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  5.60 %     4 month forward =  6.19 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  5.84 %     5 month forward =  6.45 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  5.92 %     6 month forward =  6.47 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
